  "gameData": {
    "backstory": "Growing up in the grimy heart of Street Brokeland, 'Grease' was forced to hustle from the beak up. His crowbar, affectionately named 'Crow-Killer,' has pried open more than just locked doors; it's his ticket to survival in the dog-eat-duck world of Subchain City.",
